/// Semantic model steward — no PHI exposure per ADR-0016 gate 4.
/// Read-only access to the operational encounter table for measure design
/// verification. Model-level structure changes still require workspace-admin
/// role (not modelled here — that's a Fabric workspace RBAC concern).
role SemanticOwner
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission encounter = IF([_data_quality] = "phi", FALSE, TRUE)

	member 'admin@mngenvmcap164444.onmicrosoft.com'
